# EXPECT-SUBSTRING: KHAC KIEU
# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
# Conditional expression hai nhanh LECH KIEU phai bi tu choi luc bien dich.
#
# Khong co file test thuong nao the loai nay: noi dung ben duoi se bien dich
# THANH CONG nen khong the chay de kiem tra. Day la ly do Testkit/negative/
# ton tai.
#
# `c` la int, `"a"` la chuoi. Truoc khi co kiem tra (2026-09-29), local tam
# cua conditional duoc khai kieu int64 (do `_infer_dtype` lay kieu cua nhanh
# DUNG) roi `_expr_ternary` luu mot object reference vao slot do bang
# `stloc.s`. Ket qua: `AccessViolationException` luc chay - lam hong bo nho.
# Cac nhanh cung kieu chay dung vi kich thuoc trung, nen loi chi lo ra o
# nhanh chuoi va lai khong co test nao bat.
def run() -> "i32":
    c = 0
    s = "x" + (c if c else "a")
    return 0
